So you can review this. So I'll say looks good.

00:25:00.756 --> 00:25:07.396
Proceed. And what happens is that AWS Transform
custom will make all the necessary changes to my code files.

00:25:07.556 --> 00:25:11.796
So for example, it's going to convert
